  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52c68f0eea3893ab",
      "translationZh": "Agentic 代码审查正成为开发过程中的一个重要组成部分。它帮助你检查拉取请求，发现问题，并决定在代码发布前什么值得关注。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b02e898d6ac79e22",
      "translationZh": "但现有 AI 审查者的质量往往难以衡量，而在你知道它是否能帮助你之前，你需要了解审查者的优势。有些审查者会暴露更多问题，有些产生的噪声更少，有些在捕捉关键问题方面更强，而其他审查者则也会暴露较小的改进。你可能需要在工作流中使用代码审查来完成不同的任务。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a0e4917b0248645",
      "translationZh": "这使得了解审查者之间的实际比较变得重要：不同系统会捕捉到什么，会漏掉什么，以及它们所做的权衡。一个好的代码审查基准应能反映真实拉取请求的多样性，捕获广泛的审查发现，并能够根据严重性、类别以及精度-召回偏好进行有意义的细分。对于构建代码审查代理的团队来说，基准还应提供一个离线信号，可靠地跟踪更改是否可能提升生产环境中的体验。现有的基准往往在标签质量、覆盖率以及它们对真实世界代码审查的代表性之间做出权衡，留下了一个缺口，需要一种严格且可重复的评估方法来将这些方面结合起来。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c42a0956f459c7ea",
      "translationZh": "我们构建了 ReviewBench ，一个新的代码审查离线基准，以填补这一空白，并且它今天即可供你使用。它遵循拉取请求的语言、仓库大小和大小分布，模型来源于 GitHub 上超过 1 亿条真实拉取请求。它使用多来源金标准集和一致的评估规则，并经过了资深工程师的独立验证。同样重要的是，借助 ReviewBench，我们对 Copilot 代码审查（CCR）的离线评估在预测生产实验方向方面变得更加有效，使我们更有信心，所测量的改进反映了对用户的实际收益。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ab245dd18b27dc0",
      "translationZh": "在这篇文章中，我们将逐步介绍 ReviewBench 是如何构建的，它如何建立可靠的 ground truth 和评分，以及如何将你自己的代码审查系统上线并提交结果。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c046c6ab214b7c72",
      "translationZh": "适用于 AI 代码审查代理的真实且全面的基准",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0973f2479bf928e0",
      "translationZh": "GitHub 拉取请求",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a07c9ad2c6fe8017",
      "translationZh": "按语言、仓库大小和更改形状分析分布。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "467328877ca86411",
      "translationZh": "代表性基准语料库",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "00b668c97b35ce26",
      "translationZh": "219 个公开的 pull request，覆盖 19 种语言，已与 GitHub-wide 分布保持一致，同时保留了实质性的审查案例。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2881729825d4ec8d",
      "translationZh": "多来源金标准集",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fcf0e735b0eb8f7",
      "translationZh": "每个发现都已按严重性和类别进行标记，使用户能够获得定制化的切片。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "791a1c4588ead857",
      "translationZh": "四项指标用于衡量已知和新发现的问题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4159bc2472301b76",
      "translationZh": "客观评估",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f80ad61c4172c2c",
      "translationZh": "客观地衡量改进并在各代理之间进行比较。帮助用户选择最符合其需求的审查者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "10de3e4a93f82c62",
      "translationZh": "我们如何保持其可信度",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6af7641a7f3c98e6",
      "translationZh": "从评价标准到专家验证和生产检查的可审计链",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f577408094433b3",
      "translationZh": "所有发现的一条明确标准",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "649db9e4e03d7e23",
      "translationZh": "人工标注的开发集",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "461cc3bc422390b3",
      "translationZh": "资深工程师建立基准真值",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ee6d1af3e8fc50f",
      "translationZh": "与人类判断保持一致",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b66ca967cce72648",
      "translationZh": "所有来源采用相同标准",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3bfba21dedb639bd",
      "translationZh": "对基准质量的专家审计",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4c12c1b813366bdb",
      "translationZh": "端到端可审计",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "89be552e003d6380",
      "translationZh": "资深工程师在发布前独立标记了金标真阳性。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e09b001a2aee4dc0",
      "translationZh": "能够预测生产的离线信号",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a8852893087416e5",
      "translationZh": "基准变化会与线上实验进行对照检查",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8ad504f6100f92a6",
      "translationZh": "改进往往会在线上体现",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac15f67fd9b14875",
      "translationZh": "退步也往往会在线上体现",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "bb7f0ff105099cc8",
      "translationZh": "ReviewBench 的工作原理",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "375722d5237d811d",
      "translationZh": "我们的基准围绕五项原则构建",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2b41c59c7d9b1272",
      "translationZh": "具有代表性的拉取请求，而非演示集",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f449fff90dfe568",
      "translationZh": "我们分析了 103.9 million GitHub 拉取请求以刻画代码审查工作负载的真实世界分布。ReviewBench 包含来自 187 个公开开源许可仓库的 219 个拉取请求，覆盖 19 种语言，其语言和仓库规模分布与 GitHub 整体高度匹配。完整的基准数据集已公开可用。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72a0a46e14d38500",
      "translationZh": "我们对该分布做了一项有意的调整：虽然语言和仓库规模直接镜像 GitHub，但拉取请求的大小被加权向可审查的中部和尾部。这减少了微小、单文件更改的过度代表，同时保留了更具实质性、多文件的拉取请求，在这些请求中审查质量最为重要。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1a1ce6544bc619c5",
      "translationZh": "广泛的地面真相发现，独立判断",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1d73da53bd454e41",
      "translationZh": "没有单一的审查者（无论是人还是模型）能够识别拉取请求中所有值得发现的内容。为了构建更广泛且更可靠的地面真相发现的黄金集，我们遵循一个三阶段过程：",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "59ce1db8dd9bf8f7",
      "translationZh": "从多种来源收集候选发现。我们从真实的人工审查者、作者后续提交推断出的问题、确定性分析工具以及多个前沿LLM（跨模型系列）收集发现。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbfb9bed94b17872",
      "translationZh": "语义去重重叠的发现。我们合并那些指向同一底层问题的发现，以扩大覆盖范围，而不让生产者之间的协议人为地增加黄金集的规模或使其依赖于任何单一来源的盲点。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "594a394a6a7fc6ed",
      "translationZh": "在共享的评价规则下验证发现。发现的来源不决定其是否正确：只有当发现为真实、相关且非平凡时，才计为真阳性。我们使用 Claude Sonnet 5 作为 LLM 评分器，在所有提交上应用一致的评价规则。为确保透明度和可重复性，我们同时发布评价规则和用于应用它的判断者。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "04ca22b964feb6a9",
      "translationZh": "同时衡量已知问题和新发现问题的指标",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "105a0f8f368af388",
      "translationZh": "大多数基准测试针对固定的黄金数据集报告精确率和召回率。ReviewBench 报告两个类别中的六项指标：",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "941bbd785df6e27e",
      "translationZh": "基于事实的精确率、召回率和 F1 分数仅使用现有的金标准集标签。它们提供了严格的、同等条件下的比较：在我们已知的问题中，智能体发现了多少，以及其发现结果中有多大比例与已知问题相匹配？",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba30018a4dc70cb7",
      "translationZh": "增强型精确率、召回率和 F1 分数还会评估那些与黄金数据集中任何条目都不匹配的发现。评审员会独立判断这些未匹配的发现是真实问题还是误报，从而允许评审员因发现黄金数据集中任何生产者均未揭示的有效问题而获得认可",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4c4191c61f0e21a8",
      "translationZh": "随着审查智能体能力的提升，这一区别变得愈发重要。固定的黄金数据集必然会变得不完整，因为系统会发现其创建者未曾预料到的问题。增强型指标使 ReviewBench 能够识别这种行为，而不是自动对其进行惩罚。由于增强型召回率会根据每个智能体发现的内容扩展分母，我们使用基于事实的召回率作为跨系统比较的主要指标，并将增强型指标作为额外的单系统诊断工具。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2d874a57fc74999c",
      "translationZh": "可配置的评估，以适应不同的审阅偏好",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b6db567ca8e687cb",
      "translationZh": "不存在单一且普遍最优的审查体验。一些开发者可能希望仅关注关键问题，而另一些开发者同样重视严重性较低、非破坏性的发现。有些人偏好更广泛的覆盖范围，而另一些人则优先考虑精确性和最小化噪音。还有一些人可能有专门的需求，例如侧重于安全或隐私的审查。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "88d8a3a339f45b9b",
      "translationZh": "ReviewBench 允许按严重程度和类别对结果进行切片，而精确率和召回率则捕捉不同的操作偏好。用户还可以调整 Fβ 分数中的 β 值，以赋予召回率更多权重以实现更广泛的覆盖，或赋予精确率更多权重以降低噪声。随着这些偏好的变化，排行榜会相应重新排序，帮助用户识别最符合其审查优先级的系统。",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c96baff867b4418c",
      "translationZh": "经过内部审计并可复现地评估",
      "provider": "groq",
      "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b"
    }
  ],
